#: ../../doc/tvm-start/opt-llm.ipynb:10002
msgid "优化大语言模型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/tvm-start/opt-llm.ipynb:10004
msgid "参考：[optimize_llm](https://tvm.apache.org/docs/how_to/tutorials/optimize_llm.html)"
